<title>JAPAN: Japan Oct-Dec industry output up 3.3 pct qtr/qtr.</title>
<headline>Japan Oct-Dec industry output up 3.3 pct qtr/qtr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's industrial production in the October-December period increased a preliminary 3.3 percent from the previous quarter on a seasonally adjusted basis, the Ministry of International Trade and Industry (MITI) said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
